\intop_{a}^{b}f\left(t\right)dt=\intop_{\varphi^{-1}\left({\color{blue}a}\right)}^{\varphi^{-1}\left({\color{red}b}\right)}f\left(\varphi\left(x\right)\right)\cdot\varphi'\left(x\right)dx
