 מתכנס ונסמן:
\begin_inset Formula
\[
\intop_{a}^{b}f\left(x\right)dx:=\intop_{a}^{c_{1}}f\left(x\right)dx+\sum_{i=1}^{n-1}\intop_{c_{i}}^{c_{i}+1}f\left(x\right)dx+\intop_{c_{n}}^{b}f\left(x\right)dx
